\\ vcache_macros.6502 - the vertex cache's macros: a vertex's entry, made on a miss by
\\ vcache.6502's vcache_make.

\\ Vertex X's entry, made if it's not there yet.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     X: the vertex
\\     camx, camy: the camera
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     X: its entry
\\     Y: preserved
\\     A: corrupted

MACRO VCACHE_VERT_TO_X
    LDA vc_slot,X:BNE hit               ; made already
    JSR vcache_make
.hit
    TAX
ENDMACRO
